.SH NAME
.PP
gemini-markets-agent - Output tool schemas for AI agent frameworks


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBgemini-markets agent [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Output tool schemas in formats native to AI agent frameworks.

.PP
Supported formats:
  mcp        - Model Context Protocol (Claude, etc.)
  openai     - OpenAI function calling format
  anthropic  - Anthropic tool use format
  generic    - Generic JSON spec (same as 'spec' command)

.PP
Examples:
  # Generate MCP tools for Claude
  gemini-markets agent --format mcp -q > tools.json

.PP
# Generate OpenAI functions
  gemini-markets agent --format openai -q > functions.json

.PP
# Generate Anthropic tools
  gemini-markets agent --format anthropic -q > tools.json


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--format\fP="generic"
	output format: mcp, openai, anthropic, generic

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for agent


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	enable debug logging

.PP
\fB--no-websocket\fP[=false]
	disable WebSocket and use REST API only

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="json"
	output format: json, table, or csv

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	suppress stderr output for pure JSON piping

.PP
\fB--raw\fP[=false]
	output compact JSON without pretty-printing

.PP
\fB--sandbox\fP[=false]
	use sandbox environment

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30
	request timeout in seconds

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
